"                        底2张相加为色:比如底2张是7和9。7+9=16，最终色=16-10=6点。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换，可保位置最大\n        " = "                        Bottom 2 cards added together become the mark: e.g. the bottom 2 cards are 7 and 9. 7+9=16, so the final mark = 16-10 = 6 points. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as highest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2, which locks the position as highest\n        ";
"                   看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大次大位置。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张 21，2张 32，3张41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮位置2最大，位置1次大，如果自己是发牌的第2张，选“2张32”表示下轮位置3最大，位置2次大\n        " = "                   Look at your own first card; deal according to the marked card, and it announces the highest and second highest positions for the next round. It announces 4 results — pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card is. For example it announces: card 1 21, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 21”, meaning next round position 2 is highest and position 1 is second highest. If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 32”, meaning next round position 3 is highest and position 2 is second highest\n        ";
"                   看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大次大位置和生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。\n                        比如报:1张 212，2张 322，3张 410，4张120.\n                        如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张212”表示下轮位置2最大，位置1次大，活门2.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张322”表示下轮位置3最大，位置2次大，活门2\n        " = "                   Look at your own first card; deal according to the marked card, and it announces the highest and second highest positions plus the live/dead gate for the next round. It announces 4 results — pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card is.\n                        For example it announces: card 1 212, card 2 322, card 3 410, card 4 120.\n                        If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 212”, meaning next round position 2 is highest, position 1 is second highest, live gate 2. If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 322”, meaning next round position 3 is highest, position 2 is second highest, live gate 2\n        ";
