"                报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最小次小。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是 X=1,Y=10。一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌\n\n        " = "                Announcing 15,19 = cards 15 through 19 can all be used for marking, which locks the position as lowest and second lowest. The marking range can be changed with the X and Y parameters; the default is X=1, Y=10. It is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 to search the whole deck for a card to mark\n\n        ";
"                每人先发一张牌，哪家牌点数最大，后续牌从最大家继续发。报哪家最大。拿第一张牌的定义为第1家比如报:1张2，2张 3，3张4，4张1.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示第2家最大.\n                如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张3”表示第3家最大\n                注意:第1轮开始报!\n        " = "                Each player is dealt one card first; whichever player has the highest points, dealing continues from that player. It announces which player is highest. The player who takes the first card is defined as player 1. For example it announces: card 1 2, card 2 3, card 3 4, card 4 1. If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 2”, meaning player 2 is highest.\n                If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 3”, meaning player 3 is highest\n                Note: announcing starts from round 1!\n        ";
"                比如金花:Y设定为 3:报2341,表示发牌方式是 111的情况，第2家最大。 发牌方式是12的情况，第3家最大。发牌方式是 21的情况，第4家最大。 发牌方式是 3的情况，第1家最大拨到中间=拨的最后一张牌做色牌发牌方式由Y参数设定:\n        Y=2:【11，2】\n        Y=3:【111,12,21，3】\n        Y=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\n        Y=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\n        Y53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\n        Y=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\n        Y=55:【23，32，14，41】\n        " = "                Zha Jin Hua example: with Y set to 3, announcing 2341 means — with deal pattern 111, player 2 is highest; with deal pattern 12, player 3 is highest; with deal pattern 21, player 4 is highest; with deal pattern 3, player 1 is highest. Riffling to the middle = the last riffled card becomes the marked card. The deal pattern is set by the Y parameter:\n        Y=2:【11，2】\n        Y=3:【111,12,21，3】\n        Y=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\n        Y=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\n        Y53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\n        Y=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\n        Y=55:【23，32，14，41】\n        ";
"                看自己手里的第一张牌。每人先发一张牌，哪家牌点数最大，后续牌从最大家继续发。报哪家最大次大。拿第一张牌的定义为第1家。比如报:1张 21，2张 31，3张 41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示第2家最大，第1家次大.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张31”表示第3家最大第1家次大。注意:第1轮开始报！\n        " = "                Look at your own first card. Each player is dealt one card first; whichever player has the highest points, dealing continues from that player. It announces which players are highest and second highest. The player who takes the first card is defined as player 1. For example it announces: card 1 21, card 2 31, card 3 41, card 4 12. If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 21”, meaning player 2 is highest and player 1 is second highest. If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 31”, meaning player 3 is highest and player 1 is second highest. Note: announcing starts from round 1!\n        ";
"                看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮最大次大家。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。\n                比如报:1张21，2张32，3张41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮第2家最大，第1家次大如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张32”表示下轮第3家最大，第2家次大\n        " = "                Look at your own first card; it announces the highest and second highest players for the next round. It announces 4 results — pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card is.\n                For example it announces: card 1 21, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 21”, meaning next round player 2 is highest and player 1 is second highest. If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 32”, meaning next round player 3 is highest and player 2 is second highest\n        ";
"                看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮最大次大家和生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张212，2张 32，3张41，4张12如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮第2家最大，第1家次大，有活门2如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张32-”表示下轮第3家最大，第2家次大\n        " = "                Look at your own first card; it announces the highest and second highest players plus the live/dead gate for the next round. It announces 4 results — pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card is. For example it announces: card 1 212, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If yours is the 1st card dealt, pick “card 1 21”, meaning next round player 2 is highest, player 1 is second highest, with live gate 2. If yours is the 2nd card dealt, pick “card 2 32-”, meaning next round player 3 is highest and player 2 is second highest\n        ";
"             面牌为色去掉色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小\n        " = "             The face card is the mark; remove the marked card. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as lowest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as lowest\n        ";
"             面牌为色去掉色牌。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大\n        " = "             The face card is the mark; remove the marked card. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as highest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as highest\n        ";
"            40张斗牛 同点一样大用到的牌:123456789J J算一点 1=J\n            1)炸弹:9999>8888··>1111=JJJJ 1和J可代替组合为炸弹炸弹相同比最后一张牌\n            2)5小:五张牌相加，总点数在10以内包括10，总点数越小牌越大如1111J>11223>11233\n            3)牛牛:5张相加总数为10的倍数算牛牛。三同牛牛。普通牛牛。\n            同为牛牛时5张相加比总点数，总点数越小越大\n            4)牛9>牛8>···>牛1:3同牛，普通牛。同点一样大，不比单张，不比花色\n            5)无牛:无牛一样大\n            " = "            40-card Dou Niu. Equal points are equal in rank. Cards used: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 J. J counts as 1 point, 1 = J\n            1) Bomb: 9999 > 8888 ·· > 1111 = JJJJ. 1 and J can substitute for each other to form a bomb. Equal bombs are compared by the last card\n            2) Five Small: the 5 cards add up to 10 points or less, including 10; the smaller the total, the higher the hand, e.g. 1111J > 11223 > 11233\n            3) Niu Niu: if the 5 cards add up to a multiple of 10 it counts as Niu Niu. Three-of-a-kind Niu Niu, ordinary Niu Niu.\n            When both are Niu Niu, compare the total of the 5 cards; the smaller the total, the higher the hand\n            4) Niu 9 > Niu 8 > ··· > Niu 1: three-of-a-kind Niu, ordinary Niu. Equal points are equal in rank; single cards and suits are not compared\n            5) No Niu: all No Niu hands are equal\n            ";
"            40张斗牛用牌1到10\n            1.三同牛对10 普通牛对10一样大 如111和对10 999和对10 235和对10 118和对10一样大\n            2.三同牛对5 普通牛对5一样大 (比如111和对5 999和对5 235和对5 118和对5都是一样大)\n            3.牛牛 三同牛和普通牛都一样大\n            4.有牛+对子 有牛+99>有牛+88>有牛+77>有牛+66>有牛\n            +44>有牛+33>有牛+22>有牛+11,三同牛和普通牛一样大\n            5.牛9最大 牛1最小三同牛和普通牛\n            一样大 同点一样大不分花色\n            6.无斗的都一样" = "            40-card Dou Niu, using cards 1 to 10\n            1. Three-of-a-kind Niu with a pair of 10s and ordinary Niu with a pair of 10s are equal, e.g. 111 with a pair of 10s, 999 with a pair of 10s, 235 with a pair of 10s and 118 with a pair of 10s are all equal\n            2. Three-of-a-kind Niu with a pair of 5s and ordinary Niu with a pair of 5s are equal (e.g. 111 with a pair of 5s, 999 with a pair of 5s, 235 with a pair of 5s and 118 with a pair of 5s are all equal)\n            3. Niu Niu: three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu are equal\n            4. Niu with a pair: Niu+99 > Niu+88 > Niu+77 > Niu+66 > Niu\n            +44 > Niu+33 > Niu+22 > Niu+11; three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu are equal\n            5. Niu 9 is highest, Niu 1 is lowest. Three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu\n            are equal. Equal points are equal in rank regardless of suit\n            6. All hands with no Niu are equal";
"            52张牌\n            1.每家10张牌，比两次\n            2.大小关系：炸弹>3带2>有牛>无牛\n            3.同牛同点比最大牌\n            4.无牛比最大牌\n            5.单张大小关系: 黑桃K>...>方片A\n            " = "            52 cards\n            1. 10 cards per player, compared twice\n            2. Ranking: Bomb > Full House > Niu > No Niu\n            3. With the same Niu and the same points, compare the highest card\n            4. With No Niu, compare the highest card\n            5. Single card ranking: K of spades > ... > A of diamonds\n            ";
"            人数扑克张数:40张。用牌1-10 三条算牛 10算1点,同点一样大\n            1)5个1\n            2)5张相加=10\n            3)牛牛>5张相加为9>牛9>5张相加为8>牛8>5张相加为7>牛7>5张相加为6>牛6>牛5>牛4>牛3>牛2>牛1\n            4)同点同牛无牛一样大" = "            Players / deck size: 40 cards. Cards 1-10 are used. Three of a kind counts as Niu. 10 counts as 1 point. Equal points are equal in rank\n            1) Five 1s\n            2) The 5 cards add up to 10\n            3) Niu Niu > 5 cards adding up to 9 > Niu 9 > 5 cards adding up to 8 > Niu 8 > 5 cards adding up to 7 > Niu 7 > 5 cards adding up to 6 > Niu 6 > Niu 5 > Niu 4 > Niu 3 > Niu 2 > Niu 1\n            4) With the same points, the same Niu and No Niu hands are equal";
"            人数牌数:52张(没有大小王)每家5张牌\n            1)5大:5张牌点数和40点以上，包\n            括40点\n            手法10点\n            2)5小:5张牌点数和10点以内，包括10点\n            3)炸弹，4张一样的牌\n            4)3同带1对\n            5)3同牛和普通牛。都是牛5的情况，3同牛大于普通牛\n            6)同牛同点比最大的牌.\n            7)无牛比最大的牌.\n            8)单张大小:大王>小王>黑桃K>...方块K>....黑桃10>红桃10>梅花10>方块10>黑桃 9...>方块1\n            " = "            Players / deck size: 52 cards (no jokers), 5 cards per player\n            1) Five Big: the 5 cards total 40 points or more,\n            including 40 points\n            Technique 10 points\n            2) Five Small: the 5 cards total 10 points or less, including 10 points\n            3) Bomb: 4 cards of the same rank\n            4) Three of a kind with a pair\n            5) Three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu. When both are Niu 5, three-of-a-kind Niu beats ordinary Niu\n            6) With the same Niu and the same points, compare the highest card.\n            7) With No Niu, compare the highest card.\n            8) Single card ranking: big joker > small joker > K of spades > ... K of diamonds > .... 10 of spades > 10 of hearts > 10 of clubs > 10 of diamonds > 9 of spades ... > 1 of diamonds\n            ";
