"            底牌为色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大\n        " = "            The bottom card is the marked card. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as highest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as highest\n        ";
"            底牌为色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第 4张交换。可保位置最小\n        " = "            The bottom card is the marked card. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as lowest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as lowest\n        ";
"            底牌为色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大\n    " = "            The bottom card is the marked card. The marked card is dealt first. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as highest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as highest\n    ";
"            底牌为色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第 4张交换。可保位置最小\n    " = "            The bottom card is the marked card. The marked card is dealt first. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as lowest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as lowest\n    ";
"            扑克张数 52张不分花色\n            1. K Q J 算0点\n            2. 9点最大,\n            3. 0点最小, 同点庄大\n            4. 对子算点数\n            " = "            Deck size: 52 cards, suits are ignored\n            1. K, Q, J count as 0 points\n            2. 9 points is highest,\n            3. 0 points is lowest; on a tie the banker wins\n            4. A pair counts as points\n            ";
"            扑克张数 54张 52张 40张 36张 20张\n            1）四条，同样四条比大小\n            2）三条，同样三条比大小\n            3）牛，三张牌点输相加为0算牛，三张顺子也为牛。若同牛同点比最大的牌，最大牌黑桃K>...>方片A\n            4）无牛比最大牌：黑桃K>...>方片A\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 / 52 / 40 / 36 / 20 cards\n            1) Four of a Kind; equal Four of a Kind hands are compared by rank\n            2) Three of a Kind; equal Three of a Kind hands are compared by rank\n            3) Niu: if the points of the 3 cards add up to 0 it counts as Niu; 3 cards in sequence also count as Niu. With the same Niu and the same points, compare the highest card: K of spades > ... > A of diamonds\n            4) With No Niu, compare the highest card: K of spades > ... > A of diamonds\n            ";
"            扑克张数:40张\n            第一轮一人先发5张，第二轮每人先先发2张，去掉2张，最后3张为公牌。发牌配置选择自定义，按次序配置第1轮，第2轮的发牌方式。\n            1、炸弹最大10101010>9999>8888...1111\n            2、有牛:包括3同牛，普通牛。3张一样的为3同牛。3同牛3>普通牛3.同点比单张大小:黑桃10>红桃10>梅花10>方块10>黑桃9>方块1\n            3、无牛比单张:黑桃10>红桃10>梅花10>方块10>黑桃9.>方块1\n            1.9版本:\n            2个人玩玩4轮没有公牌，\n            3个人玩3轮，第3轮每人两张去掉一张3张公牌\n            " = "            Deck size: 40 cards\n            In round 1 one player is dealt 5 cards; in round 2 each player is dealt 2 cards and discards 2, and the last 3 cards are the community cards. Set the deal configuration to Custom and configure the deal pattern for round 1 and round 2 in order.\n            1. Bomb is highest: 10101010 > 9999 > 8888...1111\n            2. Niu: includes three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu. Three cards of the same rank make a three-of-a-kind Niu. Three-of-a-kind Niu 3 > ordinary Niu 3. On equal points compare single cards: 10 of spades > 10 of hearts > 10 of clubs > 10 of diamonds > 9 of spades > 1 of diamonds\n            3. With No Niu, compare single cards: 10 of spades > 10 of hearts > 10 of clubs > 10 of diamonds > 9 of spades. > 1 of diamonds\n            Version 1.9:\n            with 2 players, play 4 rounds with no community cards,\n            with 3 players, play 3 rounds; in round 3 each player gets two cards and discards one, with 3 community cards\n            ";
"            扑克张数:54张不分花色\n            1)9+k>对子，对子一样大，两黑或者两红才算对子，对子一黑一红算点数\n            2)9点>8点半.....0点最小\n            3)大王算1点，k算半点，Q算2点，J算一点，同色才为对子,不同色算点数。\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards, suits are ignored\n            1) 9+K > a pair; all pairs are equal. Only two blacks or two reds count as a pair; one black and one red counts as points\n            2) 9 points > 8.5 points ..... 0 points is lowest\n            3) The big joker counts as 1 point, K as half a point, Q as 2 points, J as 1 point. Only same-colour cards make a pair; different colours count as points.\n            ";
"            扑克张数:54张不分花色\n            1)9+k>对子，对子一样大，两黑或者两红才算对子，对子一黑一红算点数\n            2)9点>8点半.....0点最小\n            3)大王算1点，k算半点，Q算2点，J算一点，同色才为对子，不同色算点数。\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards, suits are ignored\n            1) 9+K > a pair; all pairs are equal. Only two blacks or two reds count as a pair; one black and one red counts as points\n            2) 9 points > 8.5 points ..... 0 points is lowest\n            3) The big joker counts as 1 point, K as half a point, Q as 2 points, J as 1 point. Only same-colour cards make a pair; different colours count as points.\n            ";
"            扑克张数:54张不分花色,对子算点数\n            1)九点半最大\n            2)9点>8点半>8点>.....0点最小大小王，JKQ算半点\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards, suits are ignored; a pair counts as points\n            1) Jiu Dian Ban is highest\n            2) 9 points > 8.5 points > 8 points > ..... 0 points is lowest. Jokers and J, K, Q count as half a point\n            ";
"            扑克张数:54张分花色\n            1) 9+王>对K>对Q>对J>......>对1\n            2)9点>8点半>8点>7点半>...0最小同色才算对子同点时两红>一红一黑>两黑\n            王=半点K=3 Q=2 J=1\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards, suits count\n            1) 9+joker > pair of Ks > pair of Qs > pair of Js > ...... > pair of 1s\n            2) 9 points > 8.5 points > 8 points > 7.5 points > ... 0 is lowest. Only same-colour cards make a pair. On equal points, two reds > one red and one black > two blacks\n            joker = half a point, K = 3, Q = 2, J = 1\n            ";
"            扑克张数：54张\n            1）对王>对k>对Q>...对A，2张牌全黑或者全红才算对子，对黑>对红\n            2）9点最大，0点最小，王=6点，K=3点，Q=2点，J=1点。\n            3）同点比最大牌点数，点数一样比最大牌花色黑桃>红桃>梅花>方片，K最大A最小\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards\n            1) Pair of jokers > pair of Ks > pair of Qs > ... pair of As. Only 2 cards that are both black or both red count as a pair; a black pair beats a red pair\n            2) 9 points is highest, 0 points is lowest. Joker = 6 points, K = 3 points, Q = 2 points, J = 1 point.\n            3) On equal points compare the highest card's points; if those are equal compare the highest card's suit: spades > hearts > clubs > diamonds, K highest and A lowest\n            ";
"            扑克张数：54张，不分花色\n            W=5，K=3，Q=2，J=1，A=4\n            1）对子 WW > AA > KK > QQ...22\n            2) 9点最大，0点最小，同点比最大牌不分花色，同点同最大牌庄家大，0点一样大，W>K>Q>J>.....2\n            " = "            Deck size: 54 cards, suits are ignored\n            W=5, K=3, Q=2, J=1, A=4\n            1) Pairs: WW > AA > KK > QQ...22\n            2) 9 points is highest, 0 points is lowest. On equal points compare the highest card regardless of suit; if the highest cards are also equal the banker wins; all 0-point hands are equal. W > K > Q > J > ..... 2\n            ";
"            报234:表示去掉2张面牌,可保第1家最小。第3家最大，第4家次大。如果有活门，最后再报活门。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。\n        " = "            Announcing 234 means: discard 2 face cards to lock player 1 as lowest, player 3 as highest and player 4 as second highest. If there is a live gate, it is announced last. Female voice 0 = the position can be locked as lowest without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meeting the condition was found.\n        ";
"            报5:去掉5张面牌，以底牌为色从上开始发牌可保位置最大次大\n        " = "            Announcing 5: discard 5 face cards, then with the bottom card as the mark deal from the top to lock the position as highest and second highest\n        ";
"            报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮同点且无对子。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报134=去掉1张面牌。第3轮，第4轮同点且无对子\n        " = "            It announces how many face cards to discard so that several rounds stay on the same points with no pair. The face-card discard range is set by parameters X and Y; the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meeting the condition was found. If you want to play 4 rounds, set the number of consecutive announced rounds to 4. Announcing 134 = discard 1 face card; rounds 3 and 4 will be on the same points with no pair\n        ";
"            比如报去5 23，表示去掉5张面牌，每轮面牌做色去掉色牌，第2轮，第3轮可保庄最大次大。注意:人定要把连报轮数参数调为2以上2表示在前 2轮中找最大次大，3表示在前3轮中找最大次大\n        " = "            For example, announcing discard 5 23 means: discard 5 face cards; each round the face card is the mark and the marked card is removed, so rounds 2 and 3 lock the banker as highest and second highest. Note: you must set the consecutive-rounds parameter to 2 or more — 2 means looking for highest and second highest within the first 2 rounds, 3 means within the first 3 rounds\n        ";
"            没有公牌，一人发五张\n            先比牌型，再比主要部分牌大小，不分花色。\n            同花顺\n            四条\n            葫芦，三条带一对\n            同花\n            顺子\n            三条\n            两对\n            一对\n            高牌\n            " = "            No community cards; five cards are dealt to each player\n            Compare the hand type first, then the main part of the hand; suits are ignored.\n            Straight Flush\n            Four of a Kind\n            Full House, three of a kind with a pair\n            Flush\n            Straight\n            Three of a Kind\n            Two Pair\n            Pair\n            High Card\n            ";
"            游戏说明\n            牌数:52张(没有大小王)每家4张牌，选3张规则:\n            1)豹子:3张同样大小的牌\n            2)顺金:花色相同的顺子\n            3)金花:花色相同的牌\n            4)顺子:花色不全相同的相连3张牌\n            5)对子:对A...对26) 散牌:A最大2最小\n            " = "            Game rules\n            Deck: 52 cards (no jokers), 4 cards per player, choose 3. Rules:\n            1) Three of a Kind: 3 cards of the same rank\n            2) Straight Flush: a straight in the same suit\n            3) Flush: cards of the same suit\n            4) Straight: 3 consecutive cards not all of the same suit\n            5) Pair: pair of As... pair of 2s 6) High Card: A highest, 2 lowest\n            ";
"            牌数:52张(没有大小王)每家3张牌规则:\n            1)豹子:3张同样大小的牌\n            2)顺金:花色相同的顺子\n            3)金花:花色相同的牌\n            4)顺子:QKA> A23>JQK...>234\n            5)对子:对A...对2\n            6) 散牌:A最大2最小\n            " = "            Deck: 52 cards (no jokers), 3 cards per player. Rules:\n            1) Three of a Kind: 3 cards of the same rank\n            2) Straight Flush: a straight in the same suit\n            3) Flush: cards of the same suit\n            4) Straight: QKA > A23 > JQK... > 234\n            5) Pair: pair of As... pair of 2s\n            6) High Card: A highest, 2 lowest\n            ";
"            牌数:52张(没有大小王)每家5张牌，选3张规则:\n            1)豹子:3张同样大小的牌\n            2)顺金:花色相同的顺子\n            3)金花:花色相同的牌\n            4)顺子:花色不全相同的相连3张牌\n            5)对子:对A...对2\n            6)散牌:A最大2最小\n            " = "            Deck: 52 cards (no jokers), 5 cards per player, choose 3. Rules:\n            1) Three of a Kind: 3 cards of the same rank\n            2) Straight Flush: a straight in the same suit\n            3) Flush: cards of the same suit\n            4) Straight: 3 consecutive cards not all of the same suit\n            5) Pair: pair of As... pair of 2s\n            6) High Card: A highest, 2 lowest\n            ";
"            牌数:52张(没有大小王)每家6张牌，选3张规则:\n            1)豹子:3张同样大小的牌\n            2)顺金:花色相同的顺子\n            3)金花:花色相同的牌\n            4)顺子:花色不全相同的相连3张牌\n            5)对子:对A...对2\n            6)散牌:A最大2最小\n            " = "            Deck: 52 cards (no jokers), 6 cards per player, choose 3. Rules:\n            1) Three of a Kind: 3 cards of the same rank\n            2) Straight Flush: a straight in the same suit\n            3) Flush: cards of the same suit\n            4) Straight: 3 consecutive cards not all of the same suit\n            5) Pair: pair of As... pair of 2s\n            6) High Card: A highest, 2 lowest\n            ";
"            牌数:54张牌，每家3张牌。王可变任意牌规则:\n            1)豹子: 3张同样大小的牌\n            2)顺金: 花色相同的顺子\n            3)金花:花色相同的牌\n            4) 顺子: 花色不全相同的相连3张牌\n            5) 对子: 对A...对2\n            6) 散牌: A最大 2最小\n            " = "            Deck: 54 cards, 3 cards per player. Jokers can stand in for any card. Rules:\n            1) Three of a Kind: 3 cards of the same rank\n            2) Straight Flush: a straight in the same suit\n            3) Flush: cards of the same suit\n            4) Straight: 3 consecutive cards not all of the same suit\n            5) Pair: pair of As... pair of 2s\n            6) High Card: A highest, 2 lowest\n            ";
"            玩家牌数: 2\n            1. 对子: 对A最大 > 对K >..对2\n            2. 双公: K,Q,J是公牌, 公派为0点 （K + Q > Q + J)\n            3. 9点最大，0点最小 （双公牌除外），同点比牌大（A + 8 > K + 9>..)\n            4. 同牌比最大牌花色(黑>红>梅>方)\n            " = "            Cards per player: 2\n            1. Pair: pair of As is highest > pair of Ks > .. pair of 2s\n            2. Double Gong: K, Q, J are Gong (picture) cards, and a Gong pair counts as 0 points (K + Q > Q + J)\n            3. 9 points is highest, 0 points is lowest (Double Gong excepted); on equal points compare the cards (A + 8 > K + 9 >..)\n            4. With the same cards, compare the highest card's suit (spades > hearts > clubs > diamonds)\n            ";
"            用牌40张：1-10\n            1）炸弹10101010>9999>...111\n            2) 葫芦 101010>999>...111\n            3) 牛10>牛9>牛8>...牛1，同牛比最大牌，同牌一样大\n            4）无牛比最大牌，同牌一样大" = "            40 cards used: 1-10\n            1) Bomb: 10101010 > 9999 > ...111\n            2) Full House: 101010 > 999 > ...111\n            3) Niu 10 > Niu 9 > Niu 8 > ... Niu 1; with the same Niu compare the highest card, and identical cards are equal\n            4) With No Niu compare the highest card; identical cards are equal";
"            面牌为色去掉色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小\n    " = "            The face card is the mark; remove the marked card. The marked card is dealt first. Example: announcing 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 of the deal, which locks the position as lowest. Announcing 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. This locks the position as lowest\n    ";
