"        X= 段位开始Y=段位结束\n        位置=总段位数。\n        比如X=13,Y=42,位置=5:总共5个段位，第一个段位 13-18，第2个段位 19-24，第3个段位25-30，第4个段位 31-36，第5个段位37-42。\n        报43245，表示第1个段位 活门是4，第2个段位活门是3，第3个段位活门是2，第4个段会位活门是 4，第5个段位活门是 5\n        " = "        X = segment start, Y = segment end\n        Position = total number of segments.\n        For example X=13, Y=42, Position=5: there are 5 segments in total — segment 1 is 13-18, segment 2 is 19-24, segment 3 is 25-30, segment 4 is 31-36, segment 5 is 37-42.\n        Announcing 43245 means the live gate of segment 1 is 4, of segment 2 is 3, of segment 3 is 2, of segment 4 is 4, and of segment 5 is 5\n        ";
