"        去掉面牌和底牌，两张牌相加的点数为几点，就去掉面上几张牌，报出最大次大.\n        注意 10点以上取个位数，比如两张牌相加为13点，只需去3张牌。比如 面牌 J,底牌=Q, J+Q=23点，23-20=3点，去掉3张牌。\n        有对子或同点用男声报如果最大家同点需要报最大两家和次大\n        " = "        Discard the face card and the bottom card; add the two cards' points together and discard that many cards from the top, then it announces the highest and second highest.\n        Note: for totals over 10 take the ones digit — e.g. if the two cards add up to 13 points, only 3 cards need to be discarded. For example, face card J and bottom card Q: J+Q=23 points, 23-20=3 points, so discard 3 cards.\n        If there is a pair or a tie, the male voice announces. If the highest players tie, it announces the two highest players and the second highest\n        ";
