"        如当前设置人数为4，报5,4则发5门牌可保第4门最大次大，报6，5，则发6门可保第5门是最大次大报出的门数只能大于或等于原有门数女声=最大。男声=次大\n        " = "        If the current player count is set to 4, announcing 5,4 means dealing 5 gates locks gate 4 as highest and second highest; announcing 6,5 means dealing 6 gates locks gate 5 as highest and second highest. The announced number of gates can only be greater than or equal to the original number of gates. Female voice = highest. Male voice = second highest\n        ";
"        底牌2张相加为色，从上开始发，报哪个位置最大次大 如果选择倒发，相当于中间打色，色上部分牌翻转过来开始发牌，比如 底2张为 10 和5，相加点数和=10+5=15，最终色点数=15-10=5点\n                \n                \n        " = "        The bottom 2 cards added together form the mark; deal from the top and announce which positions are the highest and second highest. If you choose reverse deal, it works like marking in the middle: the part above the marked card is flipped over and dealt first. For example, if the bottom 2 cards are 10 and 5, the point sum = 10+5 = 15, so the final mark point = 15-10 = 5 points\n                \n                \n        ";
