"        打色保位置最大次大，1=照牌打色留色.2=照牌打色去色全部，3=照牌打色去色1张。没有报结果为空.男声=次大，女声=最大第一次打色报 结果为空，可继续打色直到报出有效结果\n        " = "        Mark to lock the highest and second highest positions. 1 = mark by the card and keep marked. 2 = mark by the card and remove all marked. 3 = mark by the card and remove 1 marked card. If there is none, the announced result is empty. Male voice = second highest, female voice = highest. The first mark may announce an empty result; keep marking until a valid result is announced\n        ";
"        打色保位置最小次小，1=照牌打色留色,2=照牌打色去色全部，3=照牌打色去色1张。没有报结果为空.男声=次小，女声=最小\n        " = "        Mark to lock the lowest and second lowest positions. 1 = mark by the card and keep marked. 2 = mark by the card and remove all marked. 3 = mark by the card and remove 1 marked card. If there is none, the announced result is empty. Male voice = second lowest, female voice = lowest\n        ";
