"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最小。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。 修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to lock the lowest position. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the lowest position is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最小次小。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小次小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to lock the lowest and second lowest positions. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the lowest and second lowest positions are locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保保多轮同点。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。有活门=女声。平点=男声，半活门=男声，无对子优先.\n        每轮报当轮的最大次大生死门，照牌报下一轮最大次大生死门。保多轮轮数需要用连报轮数设置，比如设置连报轮数为4，就是保4轮同点最多。\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to hold the same points over several rounds. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Live gate = female voice. Tie = male voice, half-live gate = male voice, no pair takes priority.\n        Each round announces that round's highest, second highest and live/dead gate, and by the card it announces the next round's highest, second highest and live/dead gate. The number of rounds to hold is set by the consecutive round count; for example, setting it to 4 holds the same points for at most 4 rounds.\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮位置最大次大次数最多。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上 10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报 1 3 4= 去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮位置最大次大\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard so the highest and second highest positions are locked in as many rounds as possible. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition. To play 4 rounds, set the consecutive round count to 4. Announcing 1 3 4 = discard 1 face card; in rounds 3 and 4 the position is the highest and second highest\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮位置最大次数最多。去面牌范围由参数X Y设定:默认X=1,Y=10. 表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报13 4=去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮位置最大\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard so the highest position is locked in as many rounds as possible. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition. To play 4 rounds, set the consecutive round count to 4. Announcing 1 3 4 = discard 1 face card; in rounds 3 and 4 the position is the highest\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮同点且无9点。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内三掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内，去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌,如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4，报134=去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮同点且无9点\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to hold the same points with no 9 points over several rounds. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition. To play 4 rounds, set the consecutive round count to 4. Announcing 1 3 4 = discard 1 face card; rounds 3 and 4 have the same points with no 9 points\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保有上活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to get an upper live gate and announce which player is the highest. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保有下活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to get a lower live gate and announce which player is the highest. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition\n        ";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保有活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌\n        " = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to get a live gate and announce which player is the highest. The discard range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10. Changing it to X=1, Y=5 means discarding within the first 5. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition\n        ";
"        报哪个位置看色牌，放回原处。根据色牌发牌，报哪个位置最大\n\n        " = "        Announces which position peeks at the marked card and puts it back in place. Deal according to the marked card and announce which position is the highest\n\n        ";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张\n        " = "        Announces at which card to mark. Discard the marked card itself, deal from the top, and the highest position can be locked. The mark range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changing it to X=5, Y=10 means marking between cards 5 and 10, or between the 5th and 10th cards from the bottom\n        ";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张。\n        " = "        Announces at which card to mark. Discard the marked card itself, deal from the top, and the highest and second highest positions can be locked. The mark range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changing it to X=5, Y=10 means marking between cards 5 and 10, or between the 5th and 10th cards from the bottom.\n        ";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y-10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张\n        " = "        Announces at which card to mark. Discard the marked card itself, deal from the top, and the lowest position can be locked. The mark range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changing it to X=5, Y=10 means marking between cards 5 and 10, or between the 5th and 10th cards from the bottom\n        ";
