"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY役道:默认X修改为:X=1,Y=10.表示在下10张内打色。X=5，Y=10表示在倒数第5张到倒数第10张内打色。女=最小，男=次小\n        " = "        Announces at which card to mark. The marked card is dealt first and the lowest and second lowest positions can be locked. The mark range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the bottom 10 cards. Changing it to X=5, Y=10 means marking between the 5th and 10th cards from the bottom. Female = lowest, male = second lowest\n        ";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌抽出来先发，可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1.Y=10.表示在上下10张内打色。 修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张\n        " = "        Announces at which card to mark. The marked card is pulled out and dealt first, and the highest position can be locked. The mark range is set by the X and Y parameters: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changing it to X=5, Y=10 means marking between cards 5 and 10, or between the 5th and 10th cards from the bottom\n        ";
