"        每人先发一张牌，哪家牌点数最大，大家继续发报各家点数。明牌最大的那家定义为第1家。\n        牛牛专用，比如4个玩家，报10，8，0，2表示第一家牛10，第2家牛8，第3家无牛，第4家牛2.\n        " = "        Deal one card to each player first; the player with the highest card points is dealt next, then keep dealing to everyone and announce each player's points. The player with the highest face-up card is player 1.\n        For Niu Niu only. For example, with 4 players, announcing 10, 8, 0, 2 means player 1 has Niu 10, player 2 has Niu 8, player 3 has no Niu, and player 4 has Niu 2.\n        ";
