"        比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大。\n        " = "        For example: announcing 1, 2 = in dealing round 1, swap the 2nd and 3rd cards, which locks the highest position. Announcing 1, 2; 2, 3 = in dealing round 1 swap the 2nd and 3rd cards, and in round 2 swap the 3rd and 4th cards, which locks the highest position.\n        ";
"        比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小\n        " = "        For example: announcing 1, 2 = in dealing round 1, swap the 2nd and 3rd cards, which locks the lowest position. Announcing 1, 2; 2, 3 = in dealing round 1 swap the 2nd and 3rd cards, and in round 2 swap the 3rd and 4th cards, which locks the lowest position\n        ";
