"        比如报2341，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部第2门是活门，最大家是第4家。去掉3张底牌补到顶部，第2门是活门，最大家是第1家.保第几门活门用Y参数设定。\n        " = "        For example, announcing 2341 means: discarding 2 face cards to the bottom makes gate 2 a live gate with player 4 the highest; discarding 3 bottom cards to the top makes gate 2 a live gate with player 1 the highest. Which gate to lock as live is set by the Y parameter.\n        ";
