"        比如报2，表示抽2次底牌面牌抽第1次把右手的底牌面牌放到左手，抽第2次继续把右手的底牌面牌放到左手，右手剩下牌的底牌为色牌，再把左手的牌补到又手牌的底部，根据色牌发牌，可保位置最大最大抽牌次数用Y参数设定\n        " = "        For example, announcing 2 means drawing the bottom and face cards twice: on the first draw, move the bottom and face cards from the right hand to the left hand; on the second draw, move the bottom and face cards from the right hand to the left hand again. The bottom card of what is left in the right hand is the marked card. Then put the left-hand cards back under the right-hand cards and deal according to the marked card to lock the highest position. The maximum number of draws is set by the Y parameter\n        ";
"        比如报4231，表示去掉6张时以6为色，位置比如报较4最大、去掉7张时以7为色，位置2最大，去掉8张时以8为色位置3最大，去掉9张时以9为色，位置1最大\n        " = "        For example, announcing 4231 means: discarding 6 cards makes card 6 the mark and position 4 the highest; discarding 7 cards makes card 7 the mark and position 2 the highest; discarding 8 cards makes card 8 the mark and position 3 the highest; discarding 9 cards makes card 9 the mark and position 1 the highest\n        ";
