"        比如金花:Y设定为3，比如报 1321，4个数字，骰子为1取第一个数=1(发牌方式 111)，骰子为2取第2个数字3(发牌方式 21)，骰子为3取第3个数字 2(发牌方式 12)，骰子为4取第4个数字1(发牌方式 111).发牌方式由丫参数设定:\n        Y=2:【11，2】\n        Y=3:【111,12,21，3】\n        Y=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\n        Y=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\n        Y53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\n        Y=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\n        Y=55:【23，32，14，41】\n        " = "        For example, Zha Jin Hua: Y is set to 3. Announce 1321, four digits: if the die shows 1, take the 1st digit = 1 (deal pattern 111); if the die shows 2, take the 2nd digit 3 (deal pattern 21); if the die shows 3, take the 3rd digit 2 (deal pattern 12); if the die shows 4, take the 4th digit 1 (deal pattern 111). Deal patterns are set by parameter Y:\n        Y=2:【11，2】\n        Y=3:【111,12,21，3】\n        Y=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\n        Y=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\n        Y53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\n        Y=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\n        Y=55:【23，32，14，41】\n        ";
