"        洗看底后报位置参数指定的玩家手里的牌。位置参数变化后，再报当前位置指定的玩家的牌。比如洗看底时，位置=4，报第4家的手里的牌调位置=1，报玩家1手里的牌。X=1报单张的点数。X>1报单张的点数和花色\n        " = "        After shuffle and peek bottom, announce the hand of the player set by the position parameter. When the position parameter changes, announce the hand of the player at the new position. For example, if position = 4 at shuffle and peek bottom, it announces player 4's hand; change position to 1 and it announces player 1's hand. X=1 announces the rank of a single card. X>1 announces the rank and suit of a single card\n        ";
"        用到的牌:36张1-9\n        1.炸弹\n        2.40点:5张牌点数相加为40点以上(包括40点)\n        3.10点:5张牌点数相加为10点以下(包括10点)\n        4.葫芦: 3条加1对\n        5.顺子: 56789最大12345最小\n        6.铁板牛牛:3条加后面2张加起来是0点 (同是铁板牛牛比3条大小)\n        7.铁板牛 3>普通牛3>铁板牛 2>普通牛2\n        8.无牛比最大牌次大牌3大牌\n        9.单张 9>8.....>1\n    " = "        Cards used: 36 cards, 1-9\n        1. Bomb\n        2. 40 points: five cards adding up to 40 or more (40 included)\n        3. 10 points: five cards adding up to 10 or less (10 included)\n        4. Full House: Three of a Kind plus a Pair\n        5. Straight: 56789 highest, 12345 lowest\n        6. Iron Niu Niu: Three of a Kind plus the last 2 cards adding up to 0 points (between two Iron Niu Niu, compare the Three of a Kind)\n        7. Iron Niu 3 > regular Niu 3 > Iron Niu 2 > regular Niu 2\n        8. With no Niu, compare the highest, second highest, then 3rd highest card\n        9. Single: 9>8.....>1\n    ";
"        看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮是否有生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张2，2张0，3张0，4张0.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示下轮有活门 2.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张0-”表示下轮没有活门\n            5-10人玩:报1张高2，2张3，高2表示活门是第2门，赢的概率大于70%。没有报高赢的概率大于60%小于70%\n        " = "        Look at your own first card, then it announces whether the next round has a live/dead gate. Four results are announced; pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card is. For example: card 1 -> 2, card 2 -> 0, card 3 -> 0, card 4 -> 0. If you are the 1st card dealt, take \"card 1 -> 2\", meaning the next round has live gate 2. If you are the 2nd card dealt, take \"card 2 -> 0-\", meaning the next round has no live gate\n            With 5-10 players: announce card 1 -> high 2, card 2 -> 3. \"High 2\" means the live gate is gate 2 and the win probability is above 70%. Without \"high\", the win probability is above 60% and below 70%\n        ";
"        看色为色留色。\n        比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换，可保位置最大" = "        The peeked card is the marked card, keep marked.\n        For example: announce 1, 2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of deal round 1, which locks the highest position. Announce 1, 2; 2, 3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2, which locks the highest position";
"        看色牌(第1张色牌)，色牌下面查找第2张色牌，第1张色牌和第2张色牌点数和为最终色点，\n        根据最终色点发牌，保位置最大最终色点计算规则:\n        比如2张色牌为10，5，\n        Y=10 情况下:最终色点=10 +5 =15-10=5\n        Y 不等于 10情况下:最终色点= 10 +5 =15\n        报牌张数 =1:报第2张色牌位置+2张色牌点数。比如报5、2:第2张色牌是第5张，且点数-2点。\n        报牌张数>1: 报第2张色牌位置。比如报牌张数=3.报 2,3.4:第2张色牌可以是第2张或3张或4张\n        " = "        Peek the marked card (the 1st marked card), then look below it for the 2nd marked card. The points of the 1st and 2nd marked cards add up to the final mark point,\n        Deal by the final mark point to lock the highest position. Final mark point calculation:\n        For example, if the 2 marked cards are 10 and 5,\n        If Y=10: final mark point = 10 + 5 = 15 - 10 = 5\n        If Y is not 10: final mark point = 10 + 5 = 15\n        Cards announced = 1: announce the position of the 2nd marked card + the points of the 2 marked cards. For example, announce 5, 2: the 2nd marked card is card 5, and points - 2.\n        Cards announced > 1: announce the position of the 2nd marked card. For example, with cards announced = 3, announce 2, 3, 4: the 2nd marked card can be card 2, 3 or 4\n        ";
