"        识别色牌后放回原处牌堆不变。若同时选择先看底/看顶，则是第一次看顶/看底，第二次看色后再报牌。\n        去掉色牌本身。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大\n        " = "        After the marked card is recognized it goes back in place, so the deck is unchanged. If peek bottom / peek top first is also selected, the first pass is peek top / peek bottom and the announcement comes after the mark is read on the second pass.\n        The marked card itself is discarded. For example: announce 1, 2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of deal round 1, which locks the highest position. Announce 1, 2; 2, 3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2. Locks the highest position\n        ";
