"    54张，52张，48张\n    1)最大:三个混合公(任意JQK王)同是混公比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,方片>黑桃>红心>梅花3\n    2)无混公比点数(所谓点数是指三张牌点数相加的总点数取个位数的值)，0点大，9点次大，1点最小。(王，K，Q， J，10为0点)\n    3)无混公比点数，同点情况下比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,方片>黑桃>红心>梅花\n    " = "    54 cards, 52 cards, 48 cards\n    1) Highest: three mixed face cards (any J, Q, K, Joker). Between two mixed hands, compare the highest card. Compare rank first; if equal, compare suit. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Diamonds > Spades > Hearts > Clubs 3\n    2) Without mixed face cards, compare points (points = the ones digit of the three cards' total). 0 points highest, 9 points second highest, 1 point lowest. (Joker, K, Q, J, 10 count as 0 points)\n    3) Without mixed face cards, compare points; on a tie compare the highest card. Compare rank first; if equal, compare suit. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Diamonds > Spades > Hearts > Clubs\n    ";
