"    不需要自定义发牌\n    52张牌，不要大小王，每人先发2张牌，再一次发3张1张1张公共牌，然后每次发公共牌之前都要烧一张牌。\n    先比牌型，再比主要部分牌大小，不分花色。\n    同花顺\n    四条\n    葫芦，三条带一对\n    同花\n    顺子\n    三条\n    两对\n    一对\n    高牌\n    " = "    No custom deal needed\n    52 cards, no Jokers. Each player gets 2 cards first, then community cards are dealt 3, then 1, then 1, with one card burned before each community deal.\n    Compare Hand Type first, then the main cards; suits are not counted.\n    Straight Flush\n    Four of a Kind\n    Full House, Three of a Kind plus a Pair\n    Flush\n    Straight\n    Three of a Kind\n    Two Pair\n    Pair\n    High Card\n    ";
"    不需要自定义发牌\n    使用一副去掉 2、3、4和5的牌，共36张牌。\n    短牌皇家同花顺：A-6-7-8-9 的同花顺。\n    短牌同花顺：任意五张同花的连续牌。\n    四条：四张相同的牌。\n    满堂红：三张相同的牌加上一对。\n    短牌同花：五张同花但非连续的牌。\n    短牌顺子：A-6-7-8-9 或更高的五张连续牌。\n    三条：三张相同的牌。\n    两对：两对不同的牌。\n    一对：两张相同的牌。\n    高牌：没有其他组合时，最大的牌。\n    " = "    No custom deal needed\n    Uses a deck with 2, 3, 4 and 5 removed, 36 cards in total.\n    Short-deck Royal Flush: the A-6-7-8-9 Straight Flush.\n    Short-deck Straight Flush: any five suited cards in sequence.\n    Four of a Kind: four cards of the same rank.\n    Full House: three cards of the same rank plus a pair.\n    Short-deck Flush: five suited cards that are not in sequence.\n    Short-deck Straight: A-6-7-8-9 or any higher five cards in sequence.\n    Three of a Kind: three cards of the same rank.\n    Two Pair: two different pairs.\n    Pair: two cards of the same rank.\n    High Card: the highest card when there is no other combination.\n    ";
