"扑克张数 54张 不分花色\n1）对王最大>对A>对K>...>对2\n2）9点>8点>...>0点\n3）王算1点K算3点Q算2点J算1点，同点同对庄家大" = "Deck: 54 cards, suits not distinguished\n1) Pair of Jokers is highest>pair of A>pair of K>...>pair of 2\n2) 9 points>8 points>...>0 points\n3) Joker counts as 1 point, K as 3 points, Q as 2 points, J as 1 point; on the same points or the same pair the dealer wins";
"扑克张数54张牌\n1:两黑或者两红算对子，\n2:对子一黑一红算点数，对子一样大不分大小，四张分头尾\n3:对王>王+9>对A>对k>.....对2.\n4:王+8> A+8> k+8>......0.同点庄赢\nJQK王=1同点比最大牌" = "Deck: 54 cards\n1: Two blacks or two reds count as a pair,\n2: A pair of one black and one red counts as points; all pairs are equal in rank; with four cards, split them into a front and a back hand\n3: Pair of Jokers>Joker+9>pair of A>pair of K>.....pair of 2.\n4: Joker+8> A+8> K+8>......0. On the same points the dealer wins\nJ, Q, K and Joker=1; on the same points compare the highest card";
"扑克张数:32张\n1:大王红桃3，红J红9红5\n2:对子大王红桃3最大，0点最小，同门点数一样，庄家大!" = "Deck: 32 cards\n1: Big Joker, heart 3, red J, red 9, red 5\n2: The pair of big Joker and heart 3 is highest, 0 points is lowest; when gates have the same points, the dealer wins!";
"扑克张数:32张\n大小王/红Q两个/红2两个/黑J两个/黑9两个/黑5两个/4个10/4个8/4个7/4个6/4个4.共32张大小排名\n1》对子:两个王>对红Q>红Q+黑9>对红2>对红8>对红4>对红10>对红6>对黑4>对黑J>对黑10>对红7>对黑6>对黑9>对黑8>对黑7>对黑5>Q和8>2和8对子要分红黑一红一黑不算对子只算点数\n2》点数:9点最大0点最小。J为1点 Q为2点小王算3点大王算6点同点时比最大的牌，\n同点同牌庄家大最大的牌从大到小:红Q>红2>红8>红4>红10>红6>黑4>黑J>黑10>红7>黑6>黑9>黑8>黑7>黑5>大王>小王" = "Deck: 32 cards\nBig and small Joker/two red Qs/two red 2s/two black Js/two black 9s/two black 5s/four 10s/four 8s/four 7s/four 6s/four 4s. 32 cards in total. Ranking\n1> Pairs: two Jokers>pair of red Q>red Q+black 9>pair of red 2>pair of red 8>pair of red 4>pair of red 10>pair of red 6>pair of black 4>pair of black J>pair of black 10>pair of red 7>pair of black 6>pair of black 9>pair of black 8>pair of black 7>pair of black 5>Q and 8>2 and 8. Pairs must be all red or all black; one red and one black is not a pair and only counts as points\n2> Points: 9 points is highest, 0 points is lowest. J is 1 point, Q is 2 points, small Joker counts as 3 points, big Joker as 6 points. On the same points compare the highest card,\non the same points and the same cards the dealer wins. Highest card, from high to low: red Q>red 2>red 8>red 4>red 10>red 6>black 4>black J>black 10>red 7>black 6>black 9>black 8>black 7>black 5>big Joker>small Joker";
