"报在第几张牌处打色，色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部，再根据色牌点数去面牌，可保位置最大。比如报3，上面3张打色去色全部，色牌是5再去5张面牌，J是去掉11张\n打色范围有参数XY设定:默让X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内打色，修改为：X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "Announce which card to mark; the marked card and the cards above it go to the bottom, then discard face cards according to the marked card's points, which locks the highest position. For example, announce 3: the top 3 cards are marked and all marked cards are removed; if the marked card is a 5, discard 5 face cards; a J discards 11 cards\nThe marking range is set by parameters X and Y: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Change it to X=5, Y=10 to mark between the 5th and the 10th card.";
"报在第几张牌处打色，色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部，底牌+打色的牌做为色牌，可保位置最大。\n打色范围有参数X Y设定:默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色\n两张牌相加点超过10，则取结果个位数为色点。如两张牌相加结果为15,色点则为5。" = "Announce which card to mark; the marked card and the cards above it go to the bottom, and the bottom card plus the marked card make up the marked card, which locks the highest position.\nThe marking range is set by parameters X and Y: default X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Change it to X=5, Y=10 to mark between the 5th and the 10th card\nIf the two cards add up to more than 10, take the ones digit of the result as the mark point. For example, if two cards add up to 15, the mark point is 5.";
